
  EdS agent - reports what is playing to the Deevnet broker.

    eth0   Deevnet site (default route, DNS, SSH)
    wlan0  a second leg, if this card was given one: the players' network,
           with no route beyond its own subnet

  Settings arrive on the card's boot partition, in eds-agent/, and are
  imported and removed at boot:   journalctl -u eds-agent-import

    eds-agent-status     each leg, the broker, the player, the agent
    eds-agent-pair       pair with iTunes (once; prints a code to type in)
    journalctl -u npagent -f

